egistered unevaluated claims H5, H10, H12, H13, H15, and H17, plus the reversed KEAP1/NFE2L2 proposal. If any new result is near the 0.025 threshold, validation should be used before acceptance; otherwise validation resources can be conserved for genuinely borderline discoveries."
